 the following...'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Meal of Meats'.\nSupplier Thissus' supply of fresh dinosaur meat is quickly dwindling and he needs help shoring up his steak stock. Make your way into the jungle and carve some meat out of freshly slain dinosaurs. The following beasts should provide adequate samples: ankylosauruses, raptors, saureks, triceratopses, and tyrannosauruses.\n\n---\n\nCollect some fresh dinosaur meat 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill dinosaur mobs until you've collected 3x \"Fresh Dinosaur Meat\". It can take up to nine kills to acquire it._\nDeliver the meat to Supplier Thissus 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Upon turn-in:_\nSupplier Thissus thanks you heartily for your assistance in resupplying his stocks, 'Thank you. Thissss will prove invaluable in keeping our people fed.'\n_Rewards:_\nFaction with The Thaell Ew (+29)\n--AND--\nTiny Parrot's Left Femur --OR-- 25 platinum\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout timer from the time of request._\n- Tiny Parrot's Left Femur [item=119714]",
