      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Thuliasaur Island [zone=1020]\n**Who:**\n- Supplier Thissus [npc=47731]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nThe Thaell Ew (Min: Apprehensive)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- The Thaell Ew +40\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dinobrush [item=119719]\n- Jungle Bloodberry [item=119738]\n- Jungle Wheatgrass [item=119715]\n- Water Shoots [item=119724]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:55:14 2014\nModified: Mon Jul 22 02:25:18 2024 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Supplier Thissus ( **click for map image**) on Thuliasaur Island._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- Minimum apprehensive faction with The Thaell Ew\n_Say \"assistance\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Supplier Thissus'\nSupplier Thissus says 'You have proven yourself trustworthy, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I need your [assistance] in shoring up our supplies, as our hunters and foragers have been losing ground to the jungle beasts.'\nYou say, 'You have my assistance...'\nSupplier Thissus says 'Very good, we could use your help collecting the following...'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Meal of Greens'.\nSupplier Thissus could use your help in shoring up the city's supply of foraged ingredients for both consumption and cooking. Many of these plants grow in specific locations around the island and he's informed you of their general whereabouts.\nThere is a specific type of root that grows at the bottom of the ponds formed by the rivers around the island. They are called 'Water Shoots' and are integral in flavoring our stews. Submerge yourself in the ponds on the interior of the island and forage for these Water Shoots.\nSmall patches of red berries grow around the Bloodfeather's village. We have no quarrel with their tribe, nor do they with us, but we have both agreed to keep our distance in order to avoid provoking the great beasts that roam the island. Forage around the center of the Bloodfeather village in order to find Blood Berries.\nJungle Wheatgrass is a common brush that grows right inside of our village just outside of our central temple. When this plant is blanched and sprinkled over a prepared dish it adds the perfect accent to offset the bitter tones in the meal. Forage around the grasslands outside of our central temple but within the walls of our city to find Jungle Wheatgrass.\nAmong the hardest of ingredients to obtain is a rare plant that grows in the footsteps of the great lumbering beasts of the central jungle simply called Dinobrush. Forage around the central jungle where the dinosaurs roam to obtain some Dinobrush.\n\n---\n\n03. Forage some Water Shoots 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n\n\n\n_Water Shoots can be foraged underwater in the ponds at the ends of rivers in the central forest._\n\n04. Forage a few Jungle Bloodberries 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n\n\n\nCan find these at 1535, -1464, 203.\n\n\n\n\n_These are foraged around the Aviak village._\n\n05. Forage some Jungle Wheatgrass 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n\n\n\n_These can be foraged in the courtyard of the Thaell Ew area._\n\n06. Forage a bit of Dinobrush 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n\n\n\n_These can be foraged anywhere around the central jungle (confirmed able on the ankylosaurus land that's surrounded by water in the center of the zone)._\n\n07. Deliver the Water Shoots to Supplier Thissus 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n\n08. Deliver the Jungle Bloodberries to Supplier Thissus 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n\n09. Deliver the Jungle Wheatgrass to Supplier Thissus 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n\n10. Deliver the Dinobrush to Supplier Thissus 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n\n\n\nSupplier Thissus thanks you heartily for your assistance in resupplying his stocks, 'Thank you. Thesssse sssshall make for fine mealssss.'\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n\n\n\n_Rewards:_\n\nFaction with The Thaell Ew (+28)\n\n\n--AND--\n\n\nTiny Parrot's Right Patella --OR-- 25 platinum\n\n\n\n\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout timer from the time of request._\n- Tiny Parrot's Right Patella [item=119746]",
