      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Thuliasaur Island [zone=1020]\n**Who:**\n- Supplier Thissus [npc=47731]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nThe Thaell Ew (Min: Apprehensive)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- The Thaell Ew +40\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Freshly Extracted Water [item=119758]\n- Jungle Moss [item=119759]\n- Jungle Water Root [item=119741]\n- Purification Tablet [item=6178]\n- Rivercap Mushroom [item=119756]\n- Tracker's Water Extractor [item=3669]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Thaell Ew shopkeeper [ _General Supplies_]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:55:24 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Supplier Thissus ( **click for map image**) on Thuliasaur Island._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- Minimum apprehensive faction with The Thaell Ew\n_Say \"assistance\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Supplier Thissus'\nSupplier Thissus says 'You have proven yourself trustworthy, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I need your [assistance] in shoring up our supplies, as our hunters and foragers have been losing ground to the jungle beasts.'\nYou say, 'You have my assistance...'\nSupplier Thissus says 'Very good, we could use your help collecting the following...'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Fortifying the Water Supply'.\nSupplier Thissus needs your help in obtaining purified water for cooking as both the freshwater rivers and the temple aquifiers are not suitable sources for his purposes. You will need to use a Tracker's Water Extractor and several Purification Tablets to extract water from the raw materials you gather. The extractor and tablets are available from the Thaell Ew shopkeeper in the eastern temple.\nYou should be able to identify the Jungle Water Roots by their bluish hue. If you follow the river south of our temple as it winds to the west, you should be able to find several suitable harvesting locations.\nRivercap mushrooms can be indentified by their subtle orange tint. They too grow along the banks of the river south of our temple.\nJungle Moss can be foraged nearly anywhere on the island if you try hard enough.\n\n---\n\n_Map points for \"thuliasaur.txt\" map files:_\nP -916.4562, -534.5851, 179.1740, 0, 0, 0, 1, roots\nP -1115.4718, -580.5717, 188.8116, 0, 0, 0, 1, roots\nP -682.3957, -521.9448, 122.6322, 0, 0, 0, 1, mushroom\nP -542.0610, -515.0436, 94.9149, 0, 0, 0, 1, mushroom\nP -316.1603, 44.1357, 36.2869, 0, 0, 0, 1, mushroom\nP -366.8631, -183.9913, 36.2938, 0, 0, 0, 1, mushroom\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nDig up some Jungle Water Roots 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Ground spawns: blue/green plant-looking things along the sides of the river that runs west-east near the tyrannosaurus' nests._\nGather some Rivercap Mushrooms 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Same area as above, appearing as tiny orange mushrooms in the water._\nForage up a bit of Jungle Moss 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_This can be foraged anywhere on the island._\n\n---\n\nExtract Fresh Water from the Jungle Water Roots 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Now you'll need to do some combines. Visit \"a Thaell Ew shopkeeper\" in the zone. It sells unlimited Purification Tablets (you'll need five of them) and has a stock of 50 \"Tracker's Water Extractor\" containers._\n_There are two ways to reset his inventory: Either kill him, or complete the task \"Resupplying the Sundries\"._\n_In a \"Tracker's Water Extractor\": Combine 1x \"Jungle Water Roots\" + 1x \"Purification Tablet\" to produce 1x \"Freshly Extracted Water\"._\n_(repeat for two combines)_\nExtract Fresh Water from the Rivercap Mushrooms 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_In a \"Tracker's Water Extractor\": Combine 1x \"Rivercap Mushrooms\" + 1x \"Purification Tablet\" to produce 1x \"Freshly Extracted Water\"._\n_(repeat for two combines)_\nExtract Fresh Water from the Jungle Moss 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_In a \"Tracker's Water Extractor\": Combine 1x \"Jungle Moss\" + 1x \"Purification Tablet\" to produce 1x \"Freshly Extracted Water\"._\n\n---\n\nDeliver the Freshly Extracted Water to Supplier Thissus 0/5 (Thuliasaur Island)\nSupplier Thissus thanks you heartily for your assistance in refilling the water supply, 'A most gracioussss thank you. Thisss will do perfectly.'\n_Rewards:_\nFaction with The Thaell Ew (+28)\n--AND--\nTiny Parrot's Right Tarsometatarsus --OR-- 25 platinum\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout timer from the time of request._\n- Tiny Parrot's Right Tarsometatarsus [item=119760]",
