      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Thuliasaur Island [zone=1020]\n**Who:**\n- Supplier Thissus [npc=47731]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nThe Thaell Ew (Min: Apprehensive)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- The Thaell Ew +40\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Fletching Kit [item=12054]\n- Scratched Dinosaur Bone [item=119761]\n- Small Lantern [item=10164]\n- Spotless Tortoise Shell [item=119762]\n- Unfinished Tracker's Water Extractor [item=119763]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Thaell Ew shopkeeper [ _General Supplies_]\n- a fierce tyrannosaurus [npc=48107]\n- a lumbering triceratops [npc=48116]\n- a raptor [npc=48121]\n- a tortoise [npc=48148]\n- a triceratops hatchling [npc=48150]\n- a tyrannosaurus hatchling [npc=48151]\n- a tyrannosaurus matriarch [npc=48152]\n- a young raptor [npc=48158]\n- a young tortoise [npc=48159]\n- an ankylosaurus [npc=48164]\n- an ankylosaurus hatchling [npc=48165]\n- an elder raptor [npc=48171]\n- an old triceratops [npc=48175]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:55:34 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Supplier Thissus ( **click for map image**) on Thuliasaur Island._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- Minimum apprehensive faction with The Thaell Ew\n_Say \"assistance\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Supplier Thissus'\nSupplier Thissus says 'You have proven yourself trustworthy, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I need your [assistance] in shoring up our supplies, as our hunters and foragers have been losing ground to the jungle beasts.'\nYou say, 'You have my assistance...'\nSupplier Thissus says 'Very good, we could use your help collecting the following...'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Resupplying the Sundries'.\nSupplier Thissus has tasked you with gathering the pieces needed to construct the purifiers that the tribe relies on to ensure a continuous supply of potable water.\nThe porous structure of dinosaur bones, once cleaned, makes them an integral portion of our water purifiers. A bone from any of the following creatures will work just fine: ankylosauruses, raptors, saureks, triceratopses, or tyrannosauruses.\nHollowed out tortoise shells work as an ideal cover in the construction of the purifiers.\nThe casing of a Small Lantern works perfectly to bring the device together. You should be able to purchase such a lantern from the Thaell Ew shopkeeper in the east temple.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nHunt down some Scratched Dinosaur Bones 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill dinosaurs until you get 2x \"Scratched Dinosaur Bone\" (will take up to six kills)._\nObtain two Spotless Tortoise Shells 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill \"tortoise\" mobs until you get 2x \"Spotless Tortoise Shell\"._\nPurchase a Small Lantern 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_\"Small Lantern\" is sold by \"a Thaell Ew shopkeeper\"._ You can hand someone a small lantern and that will register as \"purchased\". So you can just send one of your group to get lanterns for all.\n\n---\n\nCraft an Unfinished Tracker's Water Extractor 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ Although a few pieces are missing from the finished product, simply cobble these components together in a fletching kit as best you can and Supplier Thissus will worry about the rest. You should be able to purchase a Fletching Kit from the Thaell Ew haggler that has set up shop in our central temple.\n_Inside a \"Fletching Kit\" (sold by \"a Thaell Ew haggler\"), combine:_\n2x \"Scratched Dinosaur Bone\" + 2x \"Spotless Tortoise Shell\" + 1x \"Small Lantern\" to produce \"Unfinished Tracker's Water Extractor\"\n\n---\n\nReturn the Extractor to Supplier Thissus 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Hand the \"Unfinished Tracker's Water Extractor\" to Supplier Thissus._\nSupplier Thissus looks over the unfinished device and then gives you an eerie lizardman smile, 'Thisss will do nicely. Thank you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.'\nThanks to your efforts the tribe will have a reasonable supply of water purifiers for the time being.\n_Rewards:_\nFaction with The Thaell Ew (+40)\n--AND--\nTiny Parrot's Right Digits --OR-- 25 platinum\n_It isn't known whether this task is repeatable._\n- Tiny Parrot's Right Digits [item=119764]",
