      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Thuliasaur Island [zone=1020]\n**Who:**\n- Scout Krenk [npc=47729]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nThe Kromtus (Min: Dubious)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- The Kromtus +50\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Simple Bucket [item=120435]\n- Sweeping Broom [item=120436]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a pest [npc=48118]\n- molerat mess [npc=48183]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:58:42 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Scout Krenk ( **click for map image**) on Thuliasaur Island._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- Minimum dubious faction with The Kromtus\n_Say \"help\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Scout Krenk'\nScout Krenk appears startled, as if you caught him trying to nap. 'Oh, hmm, hail to you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Say, how would you like to [help] me do something? Your efforts will be fairly rewarded.'\nYou say, 'I will help...'\nScout Krenk says 'Move quickly now and...' His voice lowers, 'Don't tell the elders who you're working for.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Dirty Work'.\nScout Krenk is tired of the elders tasking him with demeaning labor so he has offered to pay you a modest sum to alleviate his workload.\nSeek out an appropriately sized bucket, anything the Kromtus would have to offer would be unwieldly for someone like you. Perhaps the Bloodfeather Aviaks would have something more your size in their storage huts.\nSeek out an appropriate sized broom. Perhaps the Thaell Ew would have something more your size in their storage rooms.\nSmash the heads of any molerat vermin you come across.\n\n---\n\n_Map points for \"thuliasaur.txt\" map files:_\nP 1460.0000, -1775.0000, 227.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, bucket\nP 1545.0000, -1785.0000, 227.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, bucket\nP 1665.0000, -1640.0000, 227.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, bucket\nP -1335.0000, -1815.0000, 149.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, broom\nP -1310.0000, -1815.0000, 149.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, broom\nP -1380.0000, -1815.0000, 149.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, broom\nP -1350.0000, -1805.0000, 149.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, broom\nP 1305.0000, -20.0000, 56.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, mess\nP 1215.0000, 100.0000, 65.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, mess\nP 1010.0000, 160.0000, 76.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, mess\nP 1125.0000, 265.0000, 76.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, mess\nP 1300.0000, 30.0000, 56.0000, 0, 0, 255, 1, mess\nP -1282.2888, -864.0880, 202.2673, 0, 0, 255, 1, a\\_pest\nP 295.0034, 17.7130, 111.7882, 0, 0, 255, 1, a\\_pest\nP 577.3378, 27.0498, 104.1326, 0, 0, 255, 1, a\\_pest\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nFetch an appropriately sized bucket 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_\"Simple Bucket\" is a ground spawn in the Aviak village._\nA dirt filled bucket sits on the ground in the corner of the room. You decide this will work perfectly for the job you've been assigned so you pick the bucket up, dump the dirt out onto the floor of the hut and go along on your merry way.\n\n---\n\nFetch an appropriately sized broom 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_This is a ground spawn in the western Thaell Ew temple (southernmost room in the west indoors area)._\nA pristine looking broom rests against the wall. This will do nicely, you wait until no one is looking then quickly grab the broom for your own use.\n\n---\n\nSweep up some of the molerat mess 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Objects called \"molerat mess\" are found in Kromtus houses. Right-click the broom to update the task._\nYou feel a bit nauseated as you use your broom to sweep the foul mess into your bucket.\nYou sweep up the mess into the bucket.\nAs you sweep the last of the molerat mess into your bucket you slam the broom against the floor and it shatters into shards of wood. Someone else can be bothered to clean 'that' mess up later...\n\n---\n\nDump the contents of the bucket in the Kromtus fishing cove 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ Swim out to the depths of the Kromtus fishing cove and empty your bucket there. (That'll teach the scout to task you with such awful work...)\n_Go underwater in the Kromtus Fishing Cove (east of the giant village) and right-click the bucket._\nYou empty the contents of the bucket into the Kromtus fishing cove and are immediately overcome with the desire to swim back to shore to minimize the amount of time you spend wading around in rat filth...\n\n---\n\nEliminate a few pests 0/2 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill any two \"a pest\" mobs (these are a bit tougher than what their /con may lead you to believe: they hit for a max ~10,000 and are fast moving)._\na pest turns toward you and lets out an unnerving hiss.\na pest has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na pest's corpse squeals loudly as it takes a mortal wound.\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Scout Krenk 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\nYou say, 'Hail, Scout Krenk'\nScout Krenk claps his hands, 'Wonderful, small one! You have very clearly earned your pay today. Just look at the sweat of your brow and the wafting odor of your clothes.' He gingerly divvies out a few coins into your hands. 'You made sure to dump the rancid mess far away from the village right? The elders would have my head if they found any more mess making its way back into the village!' You nod, saying nothing, and decide to be on your way.\nYour previous sympathy for the scout's situation now weighs against the petty sum he has awarded you with...\n_Rewards:_\nFaction with The Kromtus (+36)\n--AND--\nTiny Parrot's Left Ulna --OR-- 50 platinum\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout timer from the time of request._\n- Tiny Parrot's Left Ulna [item=120437]",
