      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Thuliasaur Island [zone=1020]\n**Who:**\n- Etsyl [npc=47734]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nBloodfeather Aviaks (Min: Dubious)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Bloodfeather Aviaks +40\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Fluffy Rabbit Fur [item=120432]\n- Glistening Butterfly Wing [item=120433]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a glistenwing [npc=48109]\n- a rabbit - Thuliasaur Island [npc=48120]\n- a young glistenwing [npc=48157]\n- an elder glistenwing [npc=48169]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:59:06 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Etsyl ( **click for map image**) on Thuliasaur Island._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- Minimum dubious faction with Bloodfeather Aviaks\n_Say \"help\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Etsyl'\nEtsyl tilts her head and eyes you curiously, '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_? They say you are strong. Maybe you can  [help] me?'\nYou say, 'Help with what?'\nEtsyl says 'I need a few  things from the jungle to craft the perfect gift.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Shining Gift'.\nEtsyl needs your help in collecting a few components needed to craft an eye-catching gift for an egret she aims to impress.\nThe wings of a glistening butterfly sparkle like nothing else in the jungle. They would be the perfect material to craft something shiny out of.\nSome rabbits have been seen hiding behind trees around the jungle. Although Etsyl feels bad about hurting the bunnies, her desire to have the finest materials outweighs her sympathies. Kill a few of the creatures and harvest their soft fur.\n\n---\n\n!\nP 11.5711, 411.4330, 30.5978, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_rabbit\nP 130.1742, 422.2267, 26.4404, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_rabbit\nP 202.7200, -409.7275, 102.5225, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_rabbit\nP -61.2105, -471.0899, 101.8493, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_rabbit\nP -326.2225, -585.8736, 103.8616, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_rabbit\nP -665.6448, -414.4725, 120.0656, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_rabbit\nP -1289.1387, -470.2083, 240.4078, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_rabbit\n\n---\n\nHunt down a few Glistening Butterfly Wings 0/5 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill any five \"glistenwing\" mobs (the named counts as well) to receive 5x \"Glistening Butterfly Wing\"._\nObtain some Fluffy Rabbit Fur 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill three rabbits to receive 3x \"Fluffy Rabbit Fur\". Don't let their /cons fool you: They hit for a max ~11,500 and have a fair amount of hitpoints._\na rabbit has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na rabbit's corpse tumbles over.\nYou remorselessly tear a handful of fur off of the dead rabbit's corpse.\n\n---\n\nDeliver the Glistening Butterfly Wings to Etsyl 0/5 (Thuliasaur Island)\nDeliver the Rabbit Fur to Etsyl 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\nEtsyl is impressed with the quality materials you were able to obtain. She offers you her heartfelt thanks and immediately begins work on crafting a trinket.\n_Rewards:_\nFaction with Bloodfeather Aviaks (+40)\n--AND--\nTiny Parrot's Coracoid --OR-- 75 platinum\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout timer from the time of request._\n- Tiny Parrot's Coracoid [item=120434]",
