      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Thuliasaur Island [zone=1020]\n**Who:**\n- Wing [npc=47735]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nBloodfeather Aviaks (Min: Dubious)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Bloodfeather Aviaks +40\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ankylosaurus Hide Spike [item=120426]\n- Freshly Felled Jungle Timber [item=120423]\n- Jungle Saurek Fang [item=120425]\n- Jungle Tree Flayer [item=120422]\n- Pristine Tyrannosaurus Femur [item=120424]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a fierce tyrannosaurus [npc=48107]\n- a roaming saurek [npc=48124]\n- a saurek hatchling [npc=48125]\n- a tree [npc=48149]\n- a tyrannosaurus hatchling [npc=48151]\n- a tyrannosaurus matriarch [npc=48152]\n- an ankylosaurus [npc=48164]\n- an ankylosaurus hatchling [npc=48165]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:59:18 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Wing ( **click for map image**) on Thuliasaur Island._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- Minimum dubious faction with Bloodfeather Aviaks\n_Say \"prove\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Wing'\nWing says 'Come to [prove] yourself to the tribe, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_? Very well, there is much to  be done to shore up our defenses and stock our stores.'\nYou say, 'Yes, I'll prove myself...'\nWing turns for a moment then hands you an old rusted axe, 'That should  be enough to cut down some usable timber!'\n_You receive a \"Jungle Tree Flayer\" upon request._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Bloodfeather Weapon Supplies'.\nWing, the chief armory officer of the Bloodfeather tribe, has tasked you with gathering the raw materials necessary to craft weapons, should the tribe need to defend themselves from a dinosaur attack.\n\n---\n\n!\n_For \"thuliasaur.txt\" map files:_\nP -1671.4072, -895.2070, 200.3788, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_tree\nP -1867.1770, -966.6122, 210.5199, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_tree\nP -1844.8130, -757.9604, 203.8328, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_tree\nP -1920.5671, -578.1066, 207.9331, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_tree\nP -1748.3872, -606.5627, 205.2812, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_tree\nP -1667.8074, -833.3997, 201.4226, 0, 0, 0, 1, a\\_tree\n\n---\n\nCut down some wood near the Tyrannosaurus' den 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ Wing has given you an old but specially crafted axe that can be used to harvest wood from the trees that grow around the tyrannosauruses' den to the west. You will need to be fairly close to each tree as you strike it with the axe and you will only be able to harvest a bit of wood from each tree that you strike.\n_Right-click the \"Jungle Tree Flayer\" on three different \"a tree\" in the far western part of the zone (these are gigantic, very tall targetable trees - there are several in the area), in the area of the Tyrannosauruses. This results in 3x \"Freshly Felled Jungle Timber\"._\n_Tree Click:_ You furiously hack away at the tree and recover some usable timber.\n_Last Tree Click:_ As you furiously hack away at the tree your Jungle Tree Flayer shatters, but thankfully you are able to recover some timber.\n\n---\n\nObtain three Jungle Saurek Fangs 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ The wild saureks you will encounter while chopping down fresh timber have fangs capable of shearing meat with practically no force required. Unfortunately for you, their jaw exerts more pressure than any other muscle in their body. Harvest a few of their fangs for use in crafting spear or arrow tips.\n_Kill three \"saurek\" mobs to receive 3x \"Jungle Saurek Fang\"._\na roaming saurek has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na roaming saurek's corpse attempts to strike one last time...\n_Update:_ You pull a bloodied saurek fang from the broken jawbone of the creature's remains.\n\n---\n\nObtain a Pristine Tyrannosaurus Femur 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ While you are tromping through the tyrannosauruses' den, try to down one of the great beasts without breaking its leg. If you manage to succeed at such a monumental task, recover the beast's femur. They make excellent blunt weapons.\n_Kill Tyrannosauruses until you've gotten a \"Pristine Tyrannosaurus Femur\"._\na tyrannosaurus hatchling has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na tyrannosaurus hatchling's corpse shakes the forest with the cries of its death!\n_No Update:_ The damage you inflicted to the tyrannosaurus left both of its femurs unrecoverably broken.\n_Update:_ You miraculously pull the tyrannosaurus' undamaged femur out of its mangled body!\n\n---\n\nObtain a Ankylosaurus Hide Spike 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ In the central jungle, you should be able to spot a few ankylosauruses roaming about. Down one of them and recover its armor-like hide spikes.\n_Kill as many ankylosauruses as it takes to get an \"Ankylosaurus Hide Spike\"._\nan ankylosaurus has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nan ankylosaurus's corpse screeches in agony before falling silent.\n_No Update:_ In the heat of battle you forgot that you were after the creature's hide spikes. Unfortunately in the state you left its body none of them were recoverable.\n_Update:_ You manage to pry off one of the armor-like spikes that adorn the creature's hide.\n\n---\n\nDeliver the Jungle Saurek Fangs to Wing 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\nDeliver the Tyrannosaurus Femur to Wing 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\nDeliver the Ankylosaurus Hide Spike to Wing 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\nDeliver the Timber to Wing 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\nWing carefully inspects the materials then looks up at you, 'The woodfelling axe did not survive? Oh well, the magnificence of these supplies far outweighs the cost of an old axe. Thank you, these will make fine weapons in the hands of our craftsmen.'\n_Rewards:_\nFaction with Bloodfeather Aviaks (+40)\n--AND--\nTiny Parrot's Ribcage --OR-- 25 platinum\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout timer from the time of request._\n- Tiny Parrot's Ribcage [item=120427]",
