      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Thuliasaur Island [zone=1020]\n**Who:**\n- Wing [npc=47735]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nBloodfeather Aviaks (Min: Dubious)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Bloodfeather Aviaks +40\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Delectable Jungle Beetle [item=120429]\n- Sapid Jungleroot Seed [item=119722]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a vicious parasite [npc=48153]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:59:33 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Wing ( **click for map image**) on Thuliasaur Island._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- Minimum dubious faction with Bloodfeather Aviaks\n_Say \"prove\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Wing'\nWing says 'Come to [prove] yourself to the tribe, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_? Very well, there is much to  be done to shore up our defenses and stock our stores.'\nYou say, 'Yes, I'll prove myself...'\nWing details what he needs to shore up the tribe's stock of supplies.\n_You receive a \"Jungle Tree Flayer\" upon request._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Bloodfeather Weapon Supplies'.\nWing, the chief armory officer of the Bloodfeather tribe, is also tasked with ensuring that the village is kept well stocked in not only basic rations but also delicacies. He has no problem ensuring a steady supply of bare necessities, but keeping a stock of the finer foods has proven difficult, so he has enlisted your help in obtaining these rarities.\n\n---\n\nForage up a few Delectable Jungle Beetles 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ There is a particular type of jungle beetle that grows just under the top layer of soil nearly anywhere in the jungle. Forage up a few of these small morsels.\nForage a few Sapid Jungleroot Seeds 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ Jungleroot seeds are plentiful, but most forages do not bother picking them up given how small they are. Take the time to harvest these delicacies and your efforts should be fairly rewarded.\nKill several vicious parasites 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ One of the biggest competitors for pungent harvestables are the destructive parasites that dwell near the bases of tree trunks. Lower the parasite population around the forest to make foraging for delectable delicacies an easier task in the future.\n_\"Delectable Jungle Beetles\" and \"Sapid Jungleroot Seeds\" can be foraged anywhere in the zone._\n_\"a vicious parasite\" can be found next to various trees. They hit for a max ~6,000 and have a fair amount of hitpoints of grey /cons. Some map points:_\nP -600.2886, -215.9749, 78.2437, 0, 0, 0, 1, parasite\nP -927.2521, -474.0094, 199.6740, 0, 0, 0, 1, parasite\nP -1155.3806, -693.7494, 203.4699, 0, 0, 0, 1, parasite\n\n---\n\nDeliver the Delectable Jungle Beetles to Wing 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\nDeliver the Sapid Jungleroot Seeds to Wing 0/3 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Upon turn-in:_\nWing is impressed with the delivery and thanks you with a small reward.\n_Rewards:_\nFaction with Bloodfeather Aviaks (+40)\n--AND--\nTiny Parrot's Keel --OR-- 25 platinum\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout timer from the time of request._\n- Tiny Parrot's Keel [item=120445]",
