      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Thuliasaur Island [zone=1020]\n**Who:**\n- Talon [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nBloodfeather Aviaks (Min: Apprehensive)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Bloodfeather Aviaks +40\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Related Creatures:**\n- an Ebonwing guardian [npc=48167]\n- an Ebonwing tender [npc=48168]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Talon #2: Softening the Shells [quest=7781]\n- Talon #3: In Shadow of Moonlight [quest=7782]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:59:45 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task is the first in a series of three and begins with Talon ( **click for map image**) on Thuliasaur Island._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- Minimum apprehensive faction with Bloodfeather Aviaks\n_Say \"willing\" to request the task._\n_Without minimum faction, you see:_\nTalon says 'There is much for you to do to help my people before I can trust you. Commander Wing or the child Etsyl may have work for you, or you could clear away some of the dinosaur threat that roams the central jungle.'\n_With apprehensive+ faction, you see:_\nTalon says 'So this is the \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ my village has been speaking of. Welcome to you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. I am Talon, leader of the Bloodfeathers. I am sure you have many questions but I must first interject with a request. You have garnered the reputation of being a formidable warrior and so I must ask if you are [willing] to help us with a growing threat.'\nYou say, 'I am willing'\nTalon says 'I knew your reputation was not an exaggeration. Help us stem the threat of the corrupted guardians that dwell to the south and I shall be happy to answer any of your questions.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Ebonwing Threat'.\nTalon, the Bloodfeather tribe's leader, is concerned with the corrupted creatures that tend to the Ebonwing nest just south of the village. These tenders and guardians are subservient to the Ebonwing Matriarch, which the Bloodfeather tribe lives in fear of, but they have proven dangerous as they have a tendency to attack or even kill any egret or scout that gets too close to the nest.\nTalon would like you to kill a few of the guardians and tenders near the nest. He fears that having his own warriors carry out this task would endanger the lives of the entire tribe should the Ebonwing Matriarch take the action as a sign of aggression toward her chicks.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nKill several Ebonwing tenders and guardians 0/4 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill four ebonwing guardians and/or tenders (the nest is due south of the Aviak village)._\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Talon 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\nYou say, 'Hail, Talon'\nTalon listens intently as you recount the details of your excursion, 'Good, good. This is a fine first step but I fear there is more to do. The situation is delicate in that we must not incur the wrath of the grand Ebonwing. Upsetting her would prove more deadly than a war with the lumbering beasts to the west. I have a plan but I will need your help in the future. Return to me when you believe you are ready.'\nTalon is thankful for your efforts but believes there is more to be done.\n_Rewards:_\nFaction with Bloodfeather Aviaks (+40)\n--AND--\nTiny Parrot's Lumbar Vertebrae --OR-- 50 platinum\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout timer from the time of request._\n- Tiny Parrot's Lumbar Vertebrae [item=119765]",
