      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Thuliasaur Island [zone=1020]\n**Who:**\n- Talon [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nBloodfeather Aviaks (Min: Apprehensive)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Bloodfeather Aviaks +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Highly Concentrated Jungle Toxin [item=119770]\n- Soulsipper's Stinger [item=119769]\n- Toxic Jungle Parasite Blood [item=119768]\n- Volatile Glistenwing Venom [item=119766]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a glistenwing [npc=48109]\n- a soulsipper [npc=48127]\n- a vicious parasite [npc=48153]\n- a young glistenwing [npc=48157]\n- an elder glistenwing [npc=48169]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Talon #1: The Ebonwing Threat [quest=7780]\n- Talon #3: In Shadow of Moonlight [quest=7782]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:59:56 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task is the second in a series of three and begins with Talon ( **click for map image**) on Thuliasaur Island._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- Minimum apprehensive faction with Bloodfeather Aviaks\n\\- Completion of \"The Ebonwing Threat\"\n_Say \"help\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Talon'\nTalon says '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, just the \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ I wanted to see. As you no doubt surmised, the guardians and tenders that inhabit the Ebonwing nest are merely servants to the Ebonwing Matriarch. Although we have not seen sign of the Matriarch in years we have lived in fear of her presence ever since we arrived on the island. Given malevolent nature of these tenders I fear the longer they remain in service to the Matriarch the more likely it is that she will be turned against us. So I must once again ask for your [help].'\nYou say, 'What help do you need?'\nTalon begins detailing his plan to turn the Matriarch against the malevolent tenders.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Softening the Shells'.\nTalon, the Bloodfeather tribe's leader, believes that a bit of subterfuge is the best plan to deal with the Ebonwing tenders. He suspects that if the Ebonwing eggs end up damaged with no obvious connection to the Bloodfeathers that the Ebonwing Matriarch will suspect the tenders to be at fault.\nExtract a bit of venom from a glistenwing butterfly. Extract the blood of a vicious parasite. Harvest the stinger from one of the colossal soulsippers that roam the jungle.\n\n---\n\n_Map points for \"thuliasaur.txt\" map files:_\nP -600.2886, -215.9749, 78.2437, 0, 0, 0, 1, parasite\nP -927.2521, -474.0094, 199.6740, 0, 0, 0, 1, parasite\nP -1155.3806, -693.7494, 203.4699, 0, 0, 0, 1, parasite\nP 624.3769, -886.6552, 208.5126, 0, 0, 0, 1, parasite\nP 423.4373, -599.3844, 193.3652, 0, 0, 0, 1, parasite\nP -8.5851, -96.5869, 61.8903, 0, 0, 0, 1, parasite\nP 160.0495, -586.7026, 143.0564, 0, 0, 0, 1, soulsipper\nP -639.1994, -433.2951, 116.9161, 0, 0, 0, 1, soulsipper\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nKill a glistenwing for its venom 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill any glistenwing to receive \"Volatile Glistenwing Venom\"._\nan elder glistenwing has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nan elder glistenwing's corpse shudders as it crumples on the ground.\nYou drain a bit of highly toxic glistenwing venom from the butterfly's corpse.\nKill a vicious parasite for its blood 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill any \"a vicious parasite\" to receive \"Toxic Jungle Parasite Blood\"._\na vicious parasite has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na vicious parasite's corpse spews a noxious fluid from its mouth as it dies.\nYou drain a bit of caustic blood from the parasite's corpse.\nKill a soulsipper for its stinger 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill any \"a soulsipper\" to receive \"Soulsipper's Stinger\"._\nYou rip the poison tipped stinger of off the soulsipper's face!\na soulsipper has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na soulsipper's corpse splatters, forming a dark stain on the terrain.\n\n---\n\nDeliver the components to Talon 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Hand them in all at once to receive a \"Highly Concentrated Jungle Toxin\"._\nTalon accepts the deadly poisons and begins concocting them into a stable suspension. After a mere minute he delicately hands you a vial, 'This should do. Make haste to the nest and avoid as much confrontation as possible.'\n\n---\n\nPoison the eggs in the Ebonwing nest 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ Do your best to sneak into the Ebonwing nest and spread the poison before you are overrun by irate birds.\n_Head into the Ebonwing nest at about /loc 900, -1600, 334 (due south of the aviak village), and right-click the toxin. Note that all of the vulture-looking Ebonwings see invisibility. There are three ravens inside the nest, all of which are a PH for the named raven Hemocoraxius, so use caution here._\nYou spread a bit of the toxic substance over each of the eggs in the hive and watch as small cracks form in the dark shells.\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Talon 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\nYou say, 'Hail, Talon'\nTalon listens intently as you recount the details of your assignment. He nods then takes a moment to consider the situation. Seconds pass before he speaks, 'We will have to see how this plays out. When you return to me I will either have good news or a final assignment for you. Thank you for all the help you have provided, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.'\nTalon must now assess the situation. Return to him when you are ready to see how his plan has played out.\n_Rewards:_\nFaction with Bloodfeather Aviaks (+42)\n--AND--\nTiny Parrot's Left Radius --OR-- 50 platinum\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout timer from the time of request._\n- Tiny Parrot's Left Radius [item=119771]",
