      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Thuliasaur Island [zone=1020]\n**Who:**\n- Talon [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Faction\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Faction Required:**\nBloodfeather Aviaks (Min: Apprehensive)\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Bloodfeather Aviaks +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Concentrated Avian Sedative [item=119774]\n- Crude Lizardman Disguise [item=119773]\n- Flattened Lizardman Skin [item=119772]\n- Sedated Ebonwing Chick [item=120418]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a bloodtear Ebonwing [npc=48089]\n- a lumbering triceratops [npc=48116]\n- a triceratops hatchling [npc=48150]\n- an Ebonwing chick [npc=48166]\n- an old triceratops [npc=48175]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Talon #1: The Ebonwing Threat [quest=7780]\n- Talon #2: Softening the Shells [quest=7781]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 04:00:06 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task is the third in a series of three and begins with Talon ( **click for map image**) on Thuliasaur Island._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Minimum Level 95\n\\- Minimum apprehensive faction with Bloodfeather Aviaks\n\\- Completion of \"The Ebonwing Threat\"\n\\- Completion of \"Softening the Shells\"\n_Say \"plan\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Talon'\nTalon says '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, grave news. During the night one of our scouts reported spotting the shadow of a creature larger than any dinosaur that roams the land. The Matriarch may have returned home. We must make haste with the final steps of our plan. It is no longer safe for you to approach the Ebonwing nest without a disguise. The tenders clearly understand that you have been working with us, but I have a [plan]...'\nYou say, 'What plan?'\nTalon begins whispering the details of a convoluted plan to capture one of the Ebonwing chicks for study.\nYou have been assigned the task 'In Shadow of Moonlight'.\nTalon, the Bloodfeather tribe leader, fears his plans to implicate the corrupted guardians for the loss of several Ebonwing eggs has failed. He is now convinced that the only way he will be able to ensure the safety of his tribe is to abduct and study one of the Ebonwing chicks.\nTalon fears that the corrupted guardians will now recognize you if you try and infiltrate the nest again so this plan begins with the construction of a disguise.\nHe wants you to recover the skin of a Thaell Ew scout but does not want you to enact violence upon a member of the Thaell Ew tribe; such an action may spark a war he is not willing to fight. Instead, he suspects that the remains of a Thaell Ew could be found in the belly of a triceratops.\n\n---\n\nP 1648.8253, -935.6730, 340.6729, 0, 0, 0, 1, chick\n!\n\n---\n\nRecover a Lizardman Skin from a triceratops 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Kill any triceratops to receive \"Flattened Lizardman Skin\"._\na triceratops hatchling has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na triceratops hatchling's corpse's lifeless mass shakes the ground as it falls.\nYou make a quick incision in the lumbering beast's side and begin rummaging around its colossal stomach for lizardman remains. It takes you mere seconds to pull out 'most of' a Thaell Ew scout's flayed husk...\n\n---\n\nDeliver the Lizardman Skin to Talon 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Upon turn-in, you receive a \"Crude Lizardman Disguise\" and \"Concentrated Avian Sedative\"._\nTalon cringes as you present the flayed lizardman skin to him. He holds it at arm's length and sighs, 'Couldn't have found one that wasn't  still dripping?' He sets it on the floor and begins cleaning the innards away before revealing a shoddy dagger affixed to a ball of twine which he then uses to stitch up the torn sections of skin. Several minutes pass before he presents you with the dried lizardman skin disguise. 'It's not all that  pretty, but it'll be enough to trick those stupid birds. Wait until nightfall then make your way to their nest again. Oh, and you'll need this.'\n\n---\n\nWait until nightfall to don the disguise 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ Talon's disguise crafting skill has proven, less than optimal, you should wait until nightfall to don the disguise and make your way into the Ebonwing nest.\n_Night time is between 7:00 P.M. and 4:00 A.M. game time (/time). Wait until then, and then right-click the disguise._\nYou place the lizardman skin over your body. Despite Talon's earlier efforts to clean the hide you feel a little uncomfortable by how wet the inside of the disguise feels against your skin.\n\n---\n\nMake your way to the Ebonwing nest and capture a chick 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\n_Task Window Says:_ Sneak into the Ebonwing nest under the aid of darkness and weaken an Ebonwing chick enough to sedate it with the concoction Talon has provided you. If you somehow lose your disguise Talon may be able to provide you with another.\n_You can find 1x \"an Ebonwing chick\" and 3x \"a bloodtear Ebonwing\" in and around the nest of the Ebonwings (found up the pathway due south of the Aviak village). DPS one of these mobs to 40% health, and then click the Sedative. This results in a \"Sedated Ebonwing Chick\". (Note: These mobs have no leash range, so you can pull them to any distance.)_\nYou splash a bit of the avian sedative in the Ebonwing chick's face. It flaps its wings violently then flutters lazily to the ground. You scoop the tired creature up into your arms.\n\n---\n\nReturn the Sedated Ebonwing Chick to Talon 0/1 (Thuliasaur Island)\nTalon carefully accepts the sleeping bird and looks it over. He hands it to one of his close advisors and turns to you, 'Once again your help has proven more than invaluable, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Although your monetary reward pales in comparison to your efforts, I offer you the humble gratitude of my entire tribe. The chick you have recovered will allow us to better understand the Grand Matriarch and perhaps someday overcome the shadow of her capricious tyranny. Should we ever need your aid again we will call upon you as a hero to our tribe.'\nTalon remains indebted to you for the help in carrying out his sometimes convoluted plans. You are left wondering if the colossal Ebonwing he speaks of will not think the Thaell Ew guilty of stealing one of her chicks...\n_Rewards:_\nFaction with Bloodfeather Aviaks (+42)\n--AND--\nTiny Parrot's Left Carpometacarpus --OR-- 100 platinum\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout timer from the time of request._\n- Tiny Parrot's Left Carpometacarpus [item=120421]",
